&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Visit &lt;a target="_blank" href="https://calendar.googe.com"&gt;Google Calendar&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Click on the arrow next to &amp;ldquo;Other Calendars.&amp;rdquo;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Select &amp;ldquo;Add a friend&amp;rsquo;s calendar.&amp;rdquo;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paste in &lt;pre&gt;&lt;a href="mailto:c_bb23ea3e1dc4d5534b53566ba5955e9bf051104f80de5bc1cb14a5595e6bbbf1@group.calendar.google.com"&gt;c_bb23ea3e1dc4d5534b53566ba5955e9bf051104f80de5bc1cb14a5595e6bbbf1@group.calendar.google.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Click &amp;ldquo;Add.&amp;rdquo;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="../img/add-calendar.jpg" alt="Steps 2 and 3"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Schedule</title><link>https://www.um-fencing.com/schedule/</link><pubDate>Fri, 24 Jun 2016 14:34:02 -0700</pubDate><guid>https://www.um-fencing.com/schedule/</guid><description>&lt;div class="alert alert-info" role="alert"&gt;
